{
  "an4.210:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.210 ",
  "an4.210:0.2": "21. Sappurisavagga ",
  "an4.210:0.3": "Catutthapāpadhammasutta ",
  "an4.210:1.1": "“Pāpadhammañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, pāpadhammena pāpadhammatarañca; ",
  "an4.210:1.2": "kalyāṇadhammañca, kalyāṇadhammena kalyāṇadhammatarañca. Taṁ suṇātha …pe…. ",
  "an4.210:2.1": "“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, pāpadhammo? ",
  "an4.210:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco micchādiṭṭhiko hoti …pe… micchāñāṇī hoti, micchāvimutti hoti. ",
  "an4.210:2.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, pāpadhammo. ",
  "an4.210:3.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, pāpadhammena pāpadhammataro? ",
  "an4.210:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco attanā ca micchādiṭṭhiko hoti, parañca micchādiṭṭhiyā samādapeti …pe… attanā ca micchāñāṇī hoti, parañca micchāñāṇe samādapeti; ",
  "an4.210:3.3": "attanā ca micchāvimutti hoti, parañca micchāvimuttiyā samādapeti. ",
  "an4.210:3.4": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, pāpadhammena pāpadhammataro. ",
  "an4.210:4.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammo? ",
  "an4.210:4.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco sammādiṭṭhiko hoti …pe… sammāñāṇī hoti, sammāvimutti hoti. ",
  "an4.210:4.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammo. ",
  "an4.210:5.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammena kalyāṇadhammataro? ",
  "an4.210:5.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco attanā ca sammādiṭṭhiko hoti, parañca sammādiṭṭhiyā samādapeti …pe… attanā ca sammāñāṇī hoti